        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "ATTENTION INVESTORS - PLEASE CONTACT ME FOR MORE INFORMATION\r\n\r\nThis property is presented as a 6 bedroom rental with a great yield.\r\n\r\nThe tenants rent rooms individually and split the utilities.\r\n\r\nThis is a very low maintenance rental property as when one Tenant leaves, another tenant brings someone in, ensuring no gaps in occupancy.\r\n\r\nUpstairs there are two double bedrooms, one single and the family bathroom. \r\n\r\nLocation:\r\nDromard Road enjoys a fantastic location close to a number of amenities including shops, restaurants, bars and cafés. There are reputable primary and secondary schools in the vicinity in addition to several creches. Sporting and leisure clubs are abundant while Crumlin Children's Hospital is a two minute walk away. The property is well served by transport links: the 122 and 123 buses run along Errigal Road, and the Drimnagh Luas stop is a ten minute walk away.\r\nThis is my first time sending you this information so please let me know if I leave anything out.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
